    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/0f72d8162bf6841f45604593cebad70e.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/0f72d8162bf6841f45604593cebad70e.apng?t=1707511094\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=140 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Catch \u2018em. Breed \u2018em. Fight \u2018em.</strong> Combine all kinds of critters together any way you want. Make never before seen monsters to fit your style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/245fe887fcdd9a57c01cd7aa96d4735e.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/245fe887fcdd9a57c01cd7aa96d4735e.webm?t=1707511094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Welcome to the Weird World of Critter Crosser!</strong><br>Explore a handmade world teeming with weird monsters and some even weirder people. Critter Crosser blends the thrills of catching, breeding, and battling monsters in real-time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/41fc61d7c6e89a346cc54ec9b89b3876.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/41fc61d7c6e89a346cc54ec9b89b3876.webm?t=1707511094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Innovative Breeding System:</strong> Breed everything! Combine different monsters to create weird new breeds. Experiment with all kinds of wacky combinations.<br></li><li> <strong>Monster Collection:</strong> Embark on a quest to capture a diverse array of unique monsters. Each creature possesses distinctive abilities and characteristics, providing endless strategies for your journey.<br></li><li> <strong>Real-Time Combat:</strong> Think quick and plan strategically. You won\u2019t be navigating menus once a battle has begun.<br></li><li> <strong>Small Open World:</strong> Explore a fun, hub world filled with secrets and surprises. Traverse through lush forests, creepy caves, and bustling towns. <br></li><li> <strong>RPG Progression:</strong> Customize not only your critters, but also your player, as you level up, learn new skills, and gain new weapons and gear.<br></li><li> <strong>Low-Stakes Storyline:</strong> You won\u2019t save the world, but you might make a difference. The joy is in the journey, not just the destination.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/0f72d8162bf6841f45604593cebad70e.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/0f72d8162bf6841f45604593cebad70e.apng?t=1707511094\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=140 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Catch \u2018em. Breed \u2018em. Fight \u2018em.</strong> Combine all kinds of critters together any way you want. Make never before seen monsters to fit your style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/245fe887fcdd9a57c01cd7aa96d4735e.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/245fe887fcdd9a57c01cd7aa96d4735e.webm?t=1707511094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Welcome to the Weird World of Critter Crosser!</strong><br>Explore a handmade world teeming with weird monsters and some even weirder people. Critter Crosser blends the thrills of catching, breeding, and battling monsters in real-time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/41fc61d7c6e89a346cc54ec9b89b3876.poster.avif?t=1707511094\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792320/extras/41fc61d7c6e89a346cc54ec9b89b3876.webm?t=1707511094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Innovative Breeding System:</strong> Breed everything! Combine different monsters to create weird new breeds. Experiment with all kinds of wacky combinations.<br></li><li> <strong>Monster Collection:</strong> Embark on a quest to capture a diverse array of unique monsters. Each creature possesses distinctive abilities and characteristics, providing endless strategies for your journey.<br></li><li> <strong>Real-Time Combat:</strong> Think quick and plan strategically. You won\u2019t be navigating menus once a battle has begun.<br></li><li> <strong>Small Open World:</strong> Explore a fun, hub world filled with secrets and surprises. Traverse through lush forests, creepy caves, and bustling towns. <br></li><li> <strong>RPG Progression:</strong> Customize not only your critters, but also your player, as you level up, learn new skills, and gain new weapons and gear.<br></li><li> <strong>Low-Stakes Storyline:</strong> You won\u2019t save the world, but you might make a difference. The joy is in the journey, not just the destination.</li></ul>",
